G="The call to be perfect, and the whole verse"
E=[(G,143,'Submitting to His truth is part of what Jesus meant when He commanded: "Be perfect, as your heavenly Father is perfect" (Matt 5:48).','Submitting to His truth is part of the call Jesus gave when He commanded: "You, therefore, must be perfect, as your heavenly Father is perfect" (Matt 5:48).')]
